WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.010
- Mila was here a few months ago

00:00:02.010 --> 00:00:04.140
and talked about the first time

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:07.080
that Ashton said he loved her
and I think it's incredible.

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:08.187
So, I wanna show you.
(Ashton chuckles)

00:00:08.187 --> 00:00:09.020
(graphics whooshing)

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:11.370
- It happened to me and
it happened to my mother.

00:00:11.370 --> 00:00:12.390
So,
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:12.390 --> 00:00:15.480
my dad told my mom he was in
love with her three months

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:19.020
into their relationship,
shmammered, fully shmammered.

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:21.270
And my mom went, "All right,
talk to me in the morning."

00:00:21.270 --> 00:00:23.160
Like, "We'll reconvene this."
- Yeah.

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:25.230
- Same thing happened
to me with my husband.

00:00:25.230 --> 00:00:26.610
Three months into our relationship,

00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:29.790
he like showed up in my house
at two o'clock in the morning

00:00:29.790 --> 00:00:31.937
and he was like, "I love you so much."

00:00:31.937 --> 00:00:33.007
(crowd laughing)
And I was like,

00:00:33.007 --> 00:00:34.050
"Oh, Lord, have-"

00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:34.883
I was like, "Go to bed."

00:00:34.883 --> 00:00:36.308
And he goes, "No, I love you so much."

00:00:36.308 --> 00:00:37.141
And I was like,

00:00:37.141 --> 00:00:38.701
"Okay, if you remember-"
- Super great, go home.

00:00:38.701 --> 00:00:40.093
(crowd clapping)

00:00:40.093 --> 00:00:40.926
So-
- Okay.

00:00:40.926 --> 00:00:43.410
- Yeah, what's happening?
- Okay.

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:45.390
- What do you remember about the night?

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:46.740
- Oh, I remember it.

00:00:46.740 --> 00:00:47.730
I'll give details.
- Okay.

00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:51.750
- I remember it distinctly
'cause I came into her house

00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:54.360
and I was singing this Kenny Chesney song

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:55.207
and I was like-

00:00:55.207 --> 00:00:58.890
♪ You and tequila make me crazy ♪

00:00:58.890 --> 00:01:01.290
'Cause there had been a little
too much tequila consumed

00:01:01.290 --> 00:01:04.140
and they both make me crazy.

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:05.820
And then I told her that I love her

00:01:05.820 --> 00:01:07.200
and I meant it when I said it.

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:10.050
And she was like, "Just tell
me, say that in the morning."

00:01:10.050 --> 00:01:12.337
And then before I woke
her up and I was like,

00:01:12.337 --> 00:01:14.559
"Hey, I love you."

00:01:14.559 --> 00:01:15.392
- Aww.

00:01:15.392 --> 00:01:16.530
- And that's how I woke
her up in the morning.

00:01:16.530 --> 00:01:18.030
I remember, distinctly.

00:01:18.030 --> 00:01:20.580
I don't know how I remember
'cause I was really drunk, but-

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:21.600
- Sometimes, though, it is,

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:24.090
it takes a little liquid courage
to let the old walls down.

00:01:24.090 --> 00:01:25.440
- It's a little juice.
- Yeah.

00:01:25.440 --> 00:01:26.903
- Get a little juice.
- Yeah.

